  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. Transfer matrices\n`tL2[a, u, M]` is the two-site $t_a(u)$ with twist $M$; `tL1[s, a, u, M]` is the one-site $t_a(u)$ of site $s$ alone (needed for the localized covectors). `T11`, `T21` (two-site) and `T11L1`, `T21L1` (one-site) are the fused $T_{(1,1)}$, $T_{(2,1)}$. Checks: quantum determinant $t_3=\\chi_3\\,\\nu_1(u)\\nu_2(u-h)\\nu_3(u-2h)$ with $\\nu_n(x)=\\prod_s(x-\\theta_s+h\\lambda_n)$, commutativity, weight conservation.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* one-site Lax at site s, as a 3x3 array of d1 x d1 blocks *)\nlax[s_, x_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, j] (x - thN[[s]]) id1 + hN EN[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\ntwistR[T_, M_] := Table[Sum[T[[i, l]] M[[l, j]], {l, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\nmono1[s_, M_][x_] := twistR[lax[s, x], M];\n(* two-site monodromy: E^(1) = E⊗1 and E^(2) = 1⊗E, so (L^(1) L^(2))_ij = Σ_k L1_ik ⊗ L2_kj *)\nmono2[M_][x_] := With[{L1 = lax[1, x], L2 = lax[2, x]}, twistR[Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[L1[[i, k]], L2[[k, j]]], {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}], M]];\n(* t_a: principal quantum minors, rows antisymmetrized, k-th factor at x-(k-1)h *)\ntq[mono_, a_, x_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[mono[x - (k - 1) hN][[σ[[k]], rows[[k]]]], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[rows]}], {rows, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ntL2[a_, x_, M_] := tq[mono2[M], a, x];\ntL1[s_, a_, x_, M_] := tq[mono1[s, M], a, x];\nT11[x_, M_] := tL2[2, x, M];\nT21[x_, M_] := tL2[2, x, M] . tL2[1, x + hN, M] - tL2[3, x + hN, M];\nT11L1[s_, x_, M_] := tL1[s, 2, x, M];\nT21L1[s_, x_, M_] := tL1[s, 2, x, M] . tL1[s, 1, x + hN, M] - tL1[s, 3, x + hN, M];\nnu[n_][x_] := Product[x - thN[[s]] + hN Λ[[n]], {s, 2}];\nZt = DiagonalMatrix[N[{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, pr]];\n{tt, tests} = AbsoluteTiming[{\n    Max[Abs[tL2[3, 1/3, Zt] - (Times @@ Diagonal[Zt]) nu[1][1/3] nu[2][1/3 - hN] nu[3][1/3 - 2 hN] IdentityMatrix[d2]]],\n    Max[Abs[With[{A = tL2[1, 1/3, Zt], B = tL2[2, -2/5, Zt]}, A . B - B . A]]],\n    Max[Abs[With[{A = T21[1/3, Zt]}, Table[If[wtBasis[[r]] =!= wtBasis[[c]], A[[r, c]], 0], {r, d2}, {c, d2}]]]]}];\nGrid[{{\"qdet residual\", tests[[1]]}, {\"[t1(1/3), t2(-2/5)]\", tests[[2]]}, {\"off-weight entries of T21\", tests[[3]]}, {\"time (s)\", tt}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
