  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. $\\Omega_{zw}$, $R$ and $x_0$\n- **$R$ and $\\Omega_{zw}$.** $R=e^{r_1E_{12}}e^{r_2E_{13}}e^{r_3E_{23}}$ (raising operators), $\\Omega_{zw}=e_1^TR$, two-site bra $\\Omega=\\Omega_{zw}\\otimes\\Omega_{zw}=(e_1\\otimes e_1)^T(R\\otimes R)$. The $r_i(z,w)$ make $\\Omega$ the vacuum of the $w$ companion twist written in the frame where $z$ is diagonal, $G'=P_{\\rm aux}G(w)P_{\\rm aux}^{-1}$. $w_3$ drops out.\n- **$x_0$.** The SoV covector $e_1$ of the companion frame, carried to the diagonal frame: $x_0=(e_1^TP_{\\rm phys}^{-1})^{\\otimes2}$. It is used only for the normalization $\\langle x_0|\\Psi\\rangle=1$ that the Q-formulas use.\n- **Checks** at a finite twist: $P_{\\rm aux}G(z)P_{\\rm aux}^{-1}=\\mathrm{diag}(z)$; $\\Omega$ is a left eigenvector of every $t_a(G')$; $\\langle x_0|e_1e_1\\rangle=(z_2-z_1)^2$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rOm[zv_, wv_] := {(wv[[1]] - zv[[1]])/(wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]),\n   ((wv[[1]] - zv[[1]]) (zv[[1]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (wv[[2]] - zv[[3]])),\n   ((wv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[2]] - wv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]]))/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (wv[[1]] - zv[[3]]) (zv[[3]] - wv[[2]]))};\nRrot[zv_, wv_] := With[{r = rOm[zv, wv]}, nexp[r[[1]] EN[1, 2]] . nexp[r[[2]] EN[1, 3]] . nexp[r[[3]] EN[2, 3]]];\nRrotInv[zv_, wv_] := With[{r = rOm[zv, wv]}, nexp[-r[[3]] EN[2, 3]] . nexp[-r[[2]] EN[1, 3]] . nexp[-r[[1]] EN[1, 2]]];\nRR[zv_, wv_] := With[{g = Rrot[zv, wv]}, KroneckerProduct[g, g]];\nOm1[zv_, wv_] := e1 . Rrot[zv, wv];\nOm2[zv_, wv_] := With[{o = Om1[zv, wv]}, kron[o, o]];\n(* frame changes, verbatim from the clean L=1 notebook: P_aux G(z) P_aux^-1 = diag(z) in aux space, P_phys its physical-space twin *)\nee[i_, j_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, ii] KroneckerDelta[j, jj], {ii, 3}, {jj, 3}];\nGc[tw_] := {{Total[tw], -(tw[[1]] tw[[2]] + tw[[1]] tw[[3]] + tw[[2]] tw[[3]]), Times @@ tw}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\nrsSol[zv_] := {s1 -> zv[[1]]^2/((zv[[1]] - zv[[2]]) (zv[[1]] - zv[[3]])), s2 -> -(zv[[2]]/(zv[[1]] (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))), s3 -> 1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]]), ρ1 -> -(zv[[3]]/zv[[2]]), ρ2 -> -(zv[[3]]/zv[[1]]), ρ3 -> (zv[[2]]^2 (zv[[3]] - zv[[1]]))/(zv[[1]]^2 (zv[[2]] - zv[[3]]))};\nPaux[zv_] := (MatrixExp[-ρ1 ee[2, 3]] . MatrixExp[-ρ2 ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[-ρ3 ee[1, 2]] . DiagonalMatrix[1/{s1, s2, s3}] . MatrixExp[-(1/zv[[1]]) ee[2, 1]] . MatrixExp[(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) ee[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[-((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) ee[3, 2]]) /. rsSol[zv];\nPphys[zv_] := With[{q = rsSol[zv]}, nexp[(ρ1 /. q) EN[3, 2]] . nexp[(ρ2 /. q) EN[3, 1]] . nexp[(ρ3 /. q) EN[2, 1]] . DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[({s1, s2, s3}[[k]] /. q)^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]] . nexp[(1/zv[[1]]) EN[1, 2]] . nexp[-(1/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) EN[1, 3]] . nexp[((zv[[1]] + zv[[2]])/(zv[[1]] zv[[2]])) EN[2, 3]]];\nx0[zv_] := With[{x = e1 . Inverse[Pphys[zv]]}, kron[x, x]];\nzT = N[{3/2, 5/4, 2/3}, pr]; wT = N[{5/2, 7/3, 3/5}, pr];\nGP = Paux[zT] . Gc[wT] . Inverse[Paux[zT]];\nGrid[{{\"P_aux G(z) P_aux^-1 - diag(z)\", Max[Abs[Paux[zT] . Gc[zT] . Inverse[Paux[zT]] - DiagonalMatrix[zT]]]},\n  {\"Ω left eigenvector of t_a(G'), a = 1,2,3 (residuals)\", Table[With[{o = Om2[zT, wT]}, With[{c = o . tL2[a, 2/9, GP]}, Max[Abs[c - (c[[1]]/o[[1]]) o]]]], {a, 3}]},\n  {\"<x0|e1e1> - (z2-z1)^2\", x0[zT] . kron[e1, e1] - (zT[[2]] - zT[[1]])^2},\n  {\"r(z,w) at the test twist\", N[rOm[zT, wT], 6]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
