  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Eigenstates at small twist and the highest-weight states\n$z=e^{\\varepsilon\\varphi}$, $w=e^{\\varepsilon\\omega}$. In each weight sector that contains a highest-weight (HW) state, diagonalize $t_1+\\pi t_2$ at $u=3/7$ and normalize $\\langle x_0|\\Psi\\rangle=1$ (so $\\|\\Psi\\|\\sim\\varepsilon^{-k}$). $P_{\\rm HW}(\\mu)$ is the orthogonal projector onto the untwisted HW vectors of weight $\\mu$ (killed by the total $E_{12}$ and $E_{23}$). The **HW-limit states** are those with $\\|P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi\\|/\\|\\Psi\\|\\to1$; there should be six: $[4,2,0],[4,1,1],[3,3,0],[3,2,1]_{1,2},[2,2,2]$. The two $[3,2,1]$ copies are ordered by the eigenvalue of $t_1+\\pi t_2$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "φ = {1/3, -2/7, 5/11}; ω = {3/4, -1/5, 2/9}; εs = {10^-3, 10^-4};\nzOf[ε_] := N[Exp[ε φ], pr]; wOf[ε_] := N[Exp[ε ω], pr];\nhwSecs = {{4, 2, 0}, {4, 1, 1}, {3, 3, 0}, {3, 2, 1}, {2, 2, 2}};\nhwB[μ_] := hwB[μ] = With[{sec = secOf[μ]}, Orthogonalize[Table[Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> n], {d2}]], {n, NullSpace[Join[EtotN[1, 2][[All, sec]], EtotN[2, 3][[All, sec]]]]}]]];\nPHW[μ_] := PHW[μ] = Transpose[hwB[μ]] . hwB[μ];\n(* all states of the HW weight sectors at twist zv, normalized <x0|Ψ> = 1; memoized on the numeric twist *)\nstatesAt[zv_] := statesAt[zv] = Module[{mix = tL2[1, 3/7, DiagonalMatrix[zv]] + N[Pi, pr] tL2[2, 3/7, DiagonalMatrix[zv]], x = x0[zv]},\n   Flatten[Table[With[{sec = secOf[μ]}, With[{es = Eigensystem[mix[[sec, sec]]]}, Table[With[{ψ = Normal[SparseArray[Thread[sec -> es[[2, k]]], {d2}]]}, With[{Ψ = ψ/(x . ψ)},\n          <|\"mu\" -> μ, \"ev\" -> es[[1, k]], \"psi\" -> Ψ, \"hwFrac\" -> Norm[PHW[μ] . Ψ]/Norm[Ψ]|>]], {k, Length[sec]}]]], {μ, hwSecs}], 1]];\nhwStates[zv_] := Select[statesAt[zv], #[\"hwFrac\"] > 9/10 &];\npickState[μ_, copy_, zv_] := SortBy[Select[hwStates[zv], #[\"mu\"] === μ &], Re[#[\"ev\"]] &][[copy]];\nhwList = {{{4, 2, 0}, 1}, {{4, 1, 1}, 1}, {{3, 3, 0}, 1}, {{3, 2, 1}, 1}, {{3, 2, 1}, 2}, {{2, 2, 2}, 1}};\n{tS, sts} = AbsoluteTiming[statesAt[zOf[εs[[1]]]]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"μ\", \"dim weight space\", \"dim HW space\", \"HW-limit states\", \"‖P_HW Ψ‖/‖Ψ‖ (ε = 10^-3)\"}},\n   Table[With[{s = Select[sts, #[\"mu\"] === μ &]}, {μ, Length[secOf[μ]], Length[hwB[μ]], Count[s, x_ /; x[\"hwFrac\"] > 9/10], N[Reverse[Sort[s[[All, \"hwFrac\"]]]], 4]}], {μ, hwSecs}],\n   {{\"time (s)\", tS}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
