  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Undoing $R$: the chain, and the signal/contamination split\nSince $\\langle\\Omega|=(e_1\\otimes e_1)^T(R\\otimes R)$, site 1's localization can be rewritten as $\\langle\\Omega|T_\\lambda(\\theta_1-2h)=f_\\lambda\\,c_\\lambda\\,(R\\otimes R)$ with\n$$c_\\lambda=\\langle v_\\lambda|R^{-1}\\otimes e_1^T,\\qquad \\langle v_\\lambda|R^{-1}=e_1^T\\,T_\\lambda^{L=1}[g^{-T}\\mathrm{diag}(z)g^T](\\theta_1-2h)\\ (g=R\\text{ in the fundamental}).$$\nFor an eigenstate, the **chain** is\n$$c_\\lambda\\cdot(R\\otimes R)\\Psi_B=\\frac{T_\\lambda^B\\,\\langle\\Omega|\\Psi_B\\rangle}{f_\\lambda}=:\\texttt{Qside}.$$\nRaising operators kill HW vectors, so $(R\\otimes R)P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi=P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi$ **exactly**. That splits Qside, at any $\\varepsilon$, into\n$$\\texttt{Qside}=\\underbrace{c_\\lambda\\cdot P_{\\rm HW}\\Psi}_{\\text{signal}\\ \\to\\ \\varepsilon^{-k}\\times\\text{CG}}+\\underbrace{c_\\lambda\\cdot(R\\otimes R)(1-P_{\\rm HW})\\Psi}_{\\text{contamination}},\\qquad \\kappa=\\texttt{Qside}/\\text{signal}.$$\nThe naive hope was $\\kappa\\to1$. The table gives $\\kappa$ at two values of $\\varepsilon$: if they agree, the contamination is of the same order as the signal. Also included is $C=c_{(2,1)}+h z_3c_{(1,1)}$ (Section 11g of the EH notebook), whose top-weight component vanishes. \"CG = 0\" marks an exactly vanishing CG number; then the column shows Qside/(‖c‖‖Ψ‖) instead of $\\kappa$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* c_λ, and the explicit form of its site-1 factor with R moved into the auxiliary twist *)\ncλ[λ_, zv_, wv_] := kron[vλ[λ, zv, wv] . RrotInv[zv, wv], e1];\ngF[zv_, wv_] := With[{r = rOm[zv, wv]}, MatrixExp[r[[1]] ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[r[[2]] ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[r[[3]] ee[2, 3]]];\nvλExplicit[λ_, zv_, wv_] := With[{M = Inverse[Transpose[gF[zv, wv]]] . DiagonalMatrix[zv] . Transpose[gF[zv, wv]]}, e1 . Switch[λ, \"11\", T11L1[1, u1, M], \"21\", T21L1[1, u1, M]]];\ncvec[λ_, zv_, wv_] := If[λ === \"C\", cλ[\"21\", zv, wv] + hN zv[[3]] cλ[\"11\", zv, wv], cλ[λ, zv, wv]];\n(* what the Q's compute: T_λ^B <Ω|Ψ_B>/f_λ, with the eigenvalue T_λ^B read off from T_λ.Ψ *)\nQside[λ_, Ψ_, zv_, wv_] := If[λ === \"C\", Qside[\"21\", Ψ, zv, wv] + hN zv[[3]] Qside[\"11\", Ψ, zv, wv],\n   With[{k = Ordering[Abs[Ψ], -1][[1]]}, ((Tλ[λ, u1, zv] . Ψ)[[k]]/Ψ[[k]]) (Om2[zv, wv] . Ψ)/fλ[λ]]];\nchainData[μ_, copy_, λ_, ε_] := Module[{zv = zOf[ε], wv = wOf[ε], Ψ, c, q, sig, sc},\n   Ψ = pickState[μ, copy, zv][\"psi\"]; c = cvec[λ, zv, wv]; q = Qside[λ, Ψ, zv, wv]; sig = c . PHW[μ] . Ψ; sc = Norm[c] Norm[Ψ];\n   {Abs[c . RR[zv, wv] . Ψ - q]/sc, If[Abs[sig] < 10^-40 sc, {\"CG = 0\", N[q/sc, 6]}, N[q/sig, 10]]}];\nGrid[{{\"<v_λ|R^-1 = e1^T T_λ[g^-T z g^T](θ1-2h), λ = (1,1), (2,1)\", Table[relRes[vλ[λ, zT, wT] . RrotInv[zT, wT], vλExplicit[λ, zT, wT]], {λ, {\"11\", \"21\"}}]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
