  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the singlet: K_b/S, K_c/S and the cancelling ratio β = b/c = -K_c/K_b, for several ε and twist directions; candidate closed forms in t = θ₁₂/h *)\nsingletRatios[ε_, φv_, ωv_] := With[{d = KS[{2, 2, 2}, 1, ε, φv, ωv]}, With[{Kb = vTop[{1, 0}, d] . d[\"K\"], Kc = vTop[{0, 1}, d] . d[\"K\"], S = vTop[{0, 1}, d] . d[\"S\"]}, N[{Kb/S, Kc/S, -Kc/Kb}, 8]]];\nsingletPred[] := With[{t = θ12/hN}, {-(t - 1)/(3 hN), (2 t - 3)/3, hN (2 t - 3)/(t - 1)}];\ndirs = {{\"φ, ω\", φ, ω}, {\"φ' = (-2/5, 3/8, 7/11), ω\", {-2/5, 3/8, 7/11}, ω}, {\"φ, ω' = (1/9, 5/4, -3/7)\", φ, {1/9, 5/4, -3/7}}};\nsingTab[] := Join[Flatten[Table[Join[{dd[[1]], ε}, singletRatios[ε, dd[[2]], dd[[3]]]], {dd, dirs}, {ε, {10^-4, 10^-5}}], 1], {Join[{\"candidate closed form\", \"\"}, N[singletPred[], 8]]}];\n{tSing, singP1} = AbsoluteTiming[singTab[]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"directions\", \"ε\", \"K_b/S\", \"K_c/S\", \"β = -K_c/K_b\"}}, singP1, {{\"time (s)\", tSing, \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
