  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* rank of the two top-killed covectors restricted to the 2-dim octet HW space (leading order, ε = 10^-4): rank 2 fixes the octet mixing *)\noctetRank = Module[{zv = zOf[10^-4], wv = wOf[10^-4], d, m}, d[λ_] := cλ[λ, zv, wv] - (cλ[λ, zv, wv] . kron[e1, e1]) kron[e1, e1]; m = {hwB[{3, 2, 1}] . d[\"11\"], hwB[{3, 2, 1}] . d[\"21\"]}; N[SingularValueList[m]/Norm[m], 4]];\nGrid[{{\"singular values of {d11, d21} on HW[3,2,1] (relative)\", octetRank}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
